--- !u!114 &3380342891000752327
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 5608611081351494714}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d85e0dc8a5f3b3d47bddeb04441c359a, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NpcTalk
  npcName: Bram
  nameColor: {r: 0.54901963, g: 0.24313726, b: 0.14901961, a: 1}
  firstVisit:
  - Name's Bram. I keep the forge, and the Village Fund along with it.
  - 'Bring back Motion Shards and we''ll put them toward fixing up Alderbrook: the
    well, the lamps, Mira''s garden, the old shrine.'
  - The ledger's not ready yet, mind. Come back with shards in your pockets.
  partsFound:
  - Wren's got {parts} of those old parts on his table now. Heavy as anything.
  - Whoever built them knew a thing or two about momentum.
  idle:
  - A heavy crate is slow to start and slow to stop. Same with stubborn blacksmiths.
  - Push the same crate together and your forces add. Two of you shove twice as hard
    as one.
  bubbleOffset: {x: 0, y: 2.7}
  closeDistance: 3.5
